OL,3,GNEWSADrunk teacher struck pupil on
OL,4,Aschool trip, hearing told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pupil was struck on the chest by a PE
OL,7,Fsupply teacher during a school football
OL,8,Ftrip to France, a fitness to practice
OL,9,Fhearing has been told.
OL,11,FShon Rowcliffe was suspended from his
OL,12,Fjob at Ysgol Bro Preseli in Crymych,
OL,13,FPembrokeshire, over claims he struck
OL,14,FPupil A, was intoxicated and swore
OL,15,Fduring the trip, an education workforce
OL,16,Fcouncil heard.
OL,18,FA group of the school's Year 7 and 8
OL,19,Ffootball players were taking part in an
OL,20,Fannual tournament at a school that is
OL,21,Ftwinned with Bro Preseli.
